      "port": "rst_ni",
      "domain": "sys_rst",
      "polarity": "active_low",
      "synchronous": false,
      "release": "rst_ni is the single active-low reset of the gpio IP and its generated register block; every state element is written on posedge clk_i with asynchronous assertion (gpio.sv:129-134,149-162 and the prim_subreg/prim_intr_hw/prim_filter_ctr instances), so deassertion must satisfy clk_i recovery/removal timing. cio_gpio_q and cio_gpio_en_q leave reset at 0 for all 32 pads, the interrupt state and the strap registers leave reset cleared."
    }
